  "ja541:119.1": "Upetaṃ annapānehi ",
  "ja541:119.2": "naccagītehi c' ūbhayaṃ ",
  "ja541:119.3": "najjo ca anupariyāti ",
  "ja541:119.4": "nānāpupphadumāyutā, ",
  "ja541:120.1": "Rājāyatanakapitthā [ca] ",
  "ja541:120.2": "ambasālā ca jambuyo ",
  "ja541:120.3": "tindukā ca piyālā ca ",
  "ja541:120.4": "dumā niccaphalā bahū. ",
